👑🧠 Birbal and the Broken Pot (Raw Story)

One day, a servant accidentally broke a valuable pot in the palace.

He became very scared.

“If the king finds out, I will be punished,” he thought.

So he blamed another servant.

The innocent servant was brought to Emperor Akbar.

Akbar asked Birbal to find the truth.

Birbal called both servants and gave them a test.

He said, “The real culprit will be punished. Speak the truth.”

The innocent servant stayed calm.

The guilty servant became nervous and started shaking.

Birbal noticed this.

He pointed to the nervous servant and said, “You are the one who broke the pot.”

The servant confessed.

Akbar punished him for lying.

💖 Moral:

Truth can be seen through actions, not just words.
